BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:aamas-2027-conference@scientific-conference-calendar
DTSTAMP:19700101T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270503
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270508
SUMMARY:AAMAS 2027 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:International Conference on Autonomous Agents and Multiagent Sy
 stems\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-30\nOfficial source: https://w
 arwick.ac.uk/fac/sci/dcs/aamas2027/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.
 io/venue-radar/#aamas-2027\nNotes: Annual flagship meeting in Hanoi. New 
 main-track submissions are closed because the Oct 1 abstract gate has pas
 sed. The separate four-page Blue Sky Ideas track is open: its OpenReview 
 form (opened Oct 20) was observed live on 2026-10-30\, and its Nov 5 gate
  only controls the Nov 12 short papers. A Demonstrations call posted Oct 
 27 (four-page paper plus video\, in the proceedings\, due Dec 27 AoE) is 
 not tracked as a separate route. The AAAI fast track is limited to highly
  rated AAAI-27 papers and is not a general new-paper route. Size XL is an
  editorial estimate. Historical acceptance covers main full papers only\,
  not Blue Sky Ideas or the newly introduced 2027 Findings track.
CATEGORIES:Machine Learning,Reinforcement Learning,Autonomous Agents & Mult
 iagent Systems,Human-AI Interaction & Deployment
URL:https://warwick.ac.uk/fac/sci/dcs/aamas2027/
LOCATION:Hanoi\, Vietnam
